                                "sense_id": "a79c2ab2-7470-3a82-bf9a-272246d8464f",
                                "text": "[…] 'dropper' — the person who presents the cheque at the bank or elsewhere — who takes the risk. […] On the other hand, 'kite droppers' usually work in teams."
                            }
